        while right_index >= start and right_index < end and arr[right_index] == i + start:
            right_index += 1
        if right_index >= start and right_index < end:
            arr[right_index - 1], arr[i] = arr[i], arr[right_index - 1]
        else:
            return i + start + 1

    return -1
```

